# Angin

Angin is a small React component library built around composable primitives,
predictable class names, and accessible defaults.

## Development

```sh
npm install
npm test
npm run typecheck
npm run build
```

Import the stylesheet once near the root of an application:

```tsx
import 'angin/src/styles/index.css';
```

Components expose native HTML props wherever possible. Every interactive
component supports `className`, and components with an `on*` callback keep the
usual React event semantics.
